    "caption": "Jensen Huang ran Nvidia for 33 years. Four days after a staff memo admitting an affair, he resigned. The affair itself was not the main issue: national-security questions, a reported relationship with an executive who reported to him, and a company built around one man. Nvidia reports Tuesday, its first results without him.\n\nGet this week's five, free every Saturday → link in bio.\n\n#Nvidia #JensenHuang #stockmarket #AI #investing\n\nSources: Nvidia 8-K (Nov 12), CNBC, The New York Times via StockAnalysis, TweakTown, ABC News, Bernstein via News Tribune, Bull Bear Report (Nov 8-14, 2026). Allegations are reported, not proven. Not investment advice."
